; v1.0 wave 13, siege (docs/31 6.1; decision D171). Multipliers, durations and
; gaps are Register "v1.0 Enemies, Bosses & Waves" > "Wave sequence" starting
; values. hunter_damage_multiplier is the Register's Hunter damage share of the
; wave damage multiplier (Hunters hit a 100 HP pool). 
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_finisher_rate"]
